
# Circuit Diagram

## Components
1. Arduino Uno
2. PIR Motion Sensor
3. LED
4. 220 Ohm Resistor
5. Jumper Wires

## Connections

PIR Sensor:
- VCC → Arduino 5V
- GND → Arduino GND
- OUT → Arduino Digital Pin 2

LED:
- Arduino Pin 13 → 220 Ohm Resistor → LED Anode (+)
- LED Cathode (-) → GND

## Operation
When motion is detected, the Arduino turns ON the LED.
When motion is not detected, the LED turns OFF.


